== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Gnome Cleric of Bertoxxulous, you will have a Stained Note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: You have chosen to become part of the Dark Reflection, and embrace the very shadows that have haunted and chased you your whole life.  There is no turning back know. . .seek out Evah Xokez, she will instruct you further.

Upon handing the note to [[Evah Xokez]]:

: [[Evah Xokez]] says, 'Join us in fulfilling the will of Bertoxxulous. You can train with us here, in the shadows of the Abbey. Wear this tunic to help conceal your true identity.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Eldritch Collective]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Gem Choppers]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Deep Muses]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Tin Patched Tunic*]]. Good luck, Cleric!

